<section>
    <div class="wrapper mission">
        <div class="mission-wrapper">
            <div class="mission-pic"><img src="~/images/About/srvmission.png" alt="Our Mission"></div>
            <div class="mission-text">
                <div class="mission-heading">Our Mission</div>
                <div class="text-group">
                    <p>Make lt Easier To Use, Better Life.</p>
                    <p>
                        SRV – Power of Dream, the mission is to empower the digital generation of India through premium accessories. Key pillars of this mission include:

                        <br>
                        Innovation: Creating durable and reliable products that enhance everyday life.

                        <br>
                        Quality: Maintaining uncompromising standards in every design.

                        <br>
                        Connection: Building meaningful relationships so every customer feels valued and supported.
                        “At SRV, our mission is to empower the digital generation of India through innovative, high-quality accessories that simplify everyday life. We focus on durability, smart design, and building meaningful connections with our customers—making technology more accessible, reliable, and impactful.”

                        If you want, I can make it more modern, premium, or startup-style 👍
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-wrapper">
            <div class="mission-pic"><img src="~/images/About/srvphy.png" alt="Our Philosophy"></div>
            <div class="mission-text">
                <div class="mission-heading">Our Philosophy</div>
                <div class="text-group">
                    <p>
                        The philosophy of SRV is built on a core mathematical success equation that defines every interaction with their customers:
                        <br><b>	S { (Service)} + R { (Relation)}  V { (Victory)}</b><br>
                        This principle guides the brand's operations through three distinct pillars:Service (S): This represents the brand's commitment to delivering exceptional, high-quality, and performance-driven mobile accessories. It is the foundation of their mission to provide innovative and reliable products that empower users.Relation (R): This focuses on building strong, trustful, and meaningful connections with customers. The goal is to ensure every customer feels valued, supported, and confident in their choice of the brand.Victory (V): When the previous two pillars are met, it results in a "Victory"—a collective win for the customers, the team, and the brand. For the customer, this means achieving their ambitions and supporting their digital lifestyle through trusted tools.The brand slogan, "Power of Dream," reinforces this philosophy by promising to empower ambitions and achieve this shared Victory together with their customers.Would you like me to create a visual graphic or social media post highlighting this equation for your brand?
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-wrapper">
            <div class="mission-pic"><img src="~/images/About/socialsrv.png" alt="Social Responsibility"></div>
            <div class="mission-text">
                <div class="mission-heading">Social Responsibility</div>
                <div class="text-group">
                    <p>
                        While the provided company documents do not explicitly list a standalone "Social Responsibility" or "CSR" policy, the brand's **Mission** and **Vision** statements reflect a strong commitment to empowering the community and fostering trust within India's digital landscape.

                        Based on the SRV – Power of Dream philosophy, their approach to responsibility can be viewed through these key areas:

                        Empowering the Digital Generation

                        Mission-Driven Purpose:** The brand is dedicated to empowering India's digital generation by providing high-quality tools that are more than just gadgets—they are essential for ambition and creativity.
                        Accessibility: By focusing on durable and performance-driven mobile accessories, the brand ensures that users everywhere have reliable technology to support their growth.

                        Building Trust and Ethical Relations

                        The Relation Pillar: A core part of the  equation is building "meaningful and trustful connections" with the community.
                        Customer-Centric Value: The brand philosophy ensures that every customer feels "valued, supported, and confident," prioritizing human connection over simple transactions.

                        Would you like me to help you draft a formal "Corporate Social Responsibility" (CSR) statement for SRV based on these values?
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>	